{color:red}*Kairi Hennoch [wrote|https://taxify.slack.com/archives/C01PT0B6D70/p1762860554762349]*{color}:
There's `/internal/getDocumentTypesList` endpoint for getting document type information, not sure if that would fit your usecase.

We have no functionality that would allow changing the document collection of an existing document. `/internal/copyDocuments` does not even allow to change the document type, only the external item type (e.g. driver registration to driver). In general, this does not seem like a safe operation - there is no guarantee that documents with same key in different collections should be allowed to be copied between cities. Unless you have doublechecked all existing document collections and confirmed that types with matching keys are actually the same document in all cases?
{quote}

